{"decisions":[{"index":0,"keep":true,"reason":"The change explicitly removes tenantID from Repository.Update and changes the match from ID plus tenant to ID alone, while the committed route contract confirms IDs may repeat across tenants and this is a production write route. The included shared-ID example also places the victim row first, so an attacker update modifies it and triggers exit 2. Restoring tenant-aware matching is actionable."}]}
